SUMMARY:Working with our Spirit Guides 
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nIn this play-shop we will gently explore 
 our connections with our spirit support teams. Our spirit teams are here t
 o support us every day\; in every moment. We may think that some things ar
 e too unimportant to “bother them with\,” but they are here to support
  us with every day and deeper issues large and small. They can help with t
 ransitions of any type. We’ll join them in a loving circle. Each play-sh
 op we’ll explore a different sphere of support\; Spirit Guides\, Earth M
 other\, Angels\, and Christ Energy. At each session you’ll learn a proce
 ss for tuning in at home\, after each session\, that you can call on at an
 y time. Each session is standalone – you can attend one or all. During e
 ach meet we’ll take the time to share\, before and after\, about your pe
 rceptions and\, experiences.\n\nSESSION ONE: THIS SESSION\, June 7 Intro t
 o working with our Spirit Guides. Our Spirit Guides love us unconditionall
 y\, and we’ll tap into that connection. Our Spirit Guides love the chanc
 e to work with us in a direct way. Some people may get a feeling sense\, o
 thers may hear the guides directly\, and some may get visuals. Each person
  has different senses which are strongest. Some folks may not have any sen
 se at all when their guides are present\; that’s ok. This is a very gent
 le exploration\, to learn more about how our Spirit Guides can support us 
 in our every day lives. In this play shop\, you’ll learn a process to do
  at home to directly connect with your guides. We'll chat before and after
  about our experiences.\n\nANGEL ESSENCE ENERGY HEALING - Lisa has been a 
 practitioner of Angel Essence Energy healing for almost two decades. This 
 gentle and supportive healing modality assists with practical issues\, dee
 per transitions\, and everything in between. Lisa has worked with individu
 als\, couples\, groups\, animals\, and with nature directly.\n\nCOST: Each
  session is $25 or $20 per session for all 4. Feel freel to reach out to L
 Isa with any question s- 865 254 7045.
